Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 10:36:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] feat(modules): extract provider and eidproxy - all 12
 business modules self-assemble

/v1/provider (OIDC login/consent/logout flow) and /v1/eid* (RP service
proxy with OAuth bearer introspection) now wire themselves in modules/.
The OIDC core (Service, signing keys, public /.well-known + /oauth2
endpoints, /admin operator surface) stays kernel-level - it is bound to
the root router and fail-closed key management. New shared services:
auth usecase and *oidcuc.Service. Golden inventory unchanged.
